{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/673","id":4729135834,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGeDi2g","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/673","number":673,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(trials): trial checkout, webhook handling and conflict guard (split T3 of #656)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Tier:** T4 (money path). **Why:** free trials with a card up front: the one-trial ledger decides who gets a trial and the trial-ending notice states what the card will be charged. **T4 trigger scan:** money (Stripe trial subscriptions, charge copy), privacy (notice and ledger logs carry ids and closed codes only). **T3 trigger scan:** schema + migrations (T1), cron worker and outbound push/email (T2), Stripe webhooks (T3). **Bounded T1:** none. **Canonical builder:** agent 115 (split of #656); fix round 6 by B-T12-116 (agent 116); fix round 7 by B-TR-117 (agent 117); fix round 8 by B-TR2-117 (agent 117); fix round 9 by B-TR3-118 (agent 118). **Parent owner:** #656. **Acceptance evidence:** Fix round table below (failing-before and passing-after CI lane runs). **Promotion triggers:** none (already T4).\n\n**Fix round table**\n\n| Round | Piece head | Findings closed | Failing-before | Passing-after |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 6 (restack, merge-only, B-T12-116) | `9719cb88` | none in T3; merges T2 `4fa2fe4a` (delta equals the T2 delta); T3 specs unchanged and green | — | PR CI at `9719cb88` |\n| 7 (restack, merge-only, B-TR-117) | `4ebf2a43` | none in T3; merges T2 `6ce54002` (delta equals the T2 delta byte for byte); T3's composed-create gate now executes | — | PR CI at `4ebf2a43` |\n| 8 (B-TR2-117) | `df76889f` | Opus C-671-4 (trial_ends_at written only for a trial that started); merges T2 `c5e7ed8e` (fix round 8); T3 specs on the T2 round 8 rules ([FIX ROUND 8](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673#issuecomment-5977778572)) | [run 37185687036](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37185687036) (1 fail) | [run 37185762015](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37185762015) (286/286 + tsc) |\n| 9 (B-TR3-118) | `5fdb5f5c` | Sol B-673-1 (an owed retry reads Stripe first: billed -> superseded, gone -> cancelled, unknown -> retry, cancel only while unbilled) and Sol C-673-2 (fresh lease clock); merges T2 `2690c07c`; B-672-3 regressions for T2 ([FIX ROUND 9](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/673#issuecomment-5982762294)) | [run 37221109080](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221109080) (12 red) | [run 37221153162](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221153162) (183/183 + tsc); probes [run 37221217159](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/actions/runs/37221217159) |\n\nSplit of #656 (free trials, backend) under the owner's PR size rule: over 3,000 changed lines is an automatic fail (MODEL_ROUTING.md 8.2, tgp-agent-context). #656 was 5,611 lines at `86223987` (FIX ROUND 5). Stack: T1 -> T2 -> T3, merged back to back; deploy only after T3, together with mobile #338. Owner adds the Stripe webhook event `customer.subscription.trial_will_end` before that deploy. The tree at T3 equalled #656 @ 86223987 (checked with git diff) until fix round 6, which adds the T1/T2 fixes. Prior verdicts on #656 (Sol RC 0/4/1 at b9939d02; no full Opus audit) do not carry; each piece needs fresh Opus 5.5 and Sol audits at its exact head (T4, money path). `tsc --noEmit` passes at every piece.\n\n**T3 (base T2, 2,887 lines after fix round 9; 2,627 after fix round 8; 2,556 before). SIZE ASSESSMENT (over 1,500): one reviewable unit (trial checkout/webhook lifecycle + specs); under the 3,000 hard limit.** trial conflict guard, checkout-webhook handling (trial start, trial_will_end notice delivery, conflict refusal), checkout and billing reads, client purchase select, CheckoutModule wiring, Stripe setup doc, .env.example line, and the notice-and-webhook, fix-round and idempotent-create specs.\n\n\n\n\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T19:31:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T17:53:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"dc54e56f9be3c5c8ac1c333b0830a6c1f7f869c1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/labels/size/size/XL","name":"size/size/XL","color":